#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:32 73c9e0a3b4d74ce4b2c0a3e9b6ff06eb
msgid ""
"**Description**: Analyzes two tool specifications to determine if one "
"tool's output can be used as input for another tool. Returns "
"compatibility information and suggested parameter mappings."
msgstr "**描述**：分析两个工具的规格，以确定一个工具的输出是否可以作为另一个工具的输入。返回兼容性信息以及建议的参数映射。"

