#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:36 eefb9ad7924244a6888bb03701383cde
msgid ""
"``source_tool`` (string) (required) The source tool specification (JSON "
"string with name, description, parameter schema, and example outputs)"
msgstr "``source_tool``（字符串）（必填）源工具规范（JSON 字符串，包含名称、描述、参数模式和示例输出）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:39 3a2c89e0fd5143d5989c4ab272b5838e
msgid ""
"``target_tool`` (string) (required) The target tool specification (JSON "
"string with name, description, parameter schema)"
msgstr "``target_tool``（字符串）（必填）目标工具规范（包含名称、描述和参数模式的 JSON 字符串）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:42 5d64677fd55f44a88f6994c2b8e55197
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``analysis_depth`` (string) (required) Level of analysis depth - quick "
"for basic compatibility, detailed for parameter mapping, comprehensive "
"for semantic analysis"
msgstr "``analysis_depth``（字符串）（可选）分析深度级别——快速用于基本兼容性，详细用于参数映射，全面用于语义分析"

