msgstr "**ToolGraphComposer**（类型：ComposeTool）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:63 fdb2d0f4724d4da6801df1fe8a3af397
msgid ""
"Builds a comprehensive graph of tool compatibility relationships in "
"ToolUniverse. Analyzes all av..."
msgstr "在ToolUniverse中构建工具兼容性关系的全面图谱。分析所有可用工具的兼容性关系..."

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst d8bdca8a3d27490694a1f454a0801fef
msgid "ToolGraphComposer tool specification"
msgstr "ToolGraphComposer 工具规范"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:69 68cc0a11729d4683ab1b966e0ec250b6
msgid "**Name**: ``ToolGraphComposer``"
msgstr "**名称**: ``ToolGraphComposer``"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:70 d19f458976e741d688457d340109c77f
msgid "**Type**: ``ComposeTool``"
msgstr "**类型**: ``ComposeTool``"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:71 596c5735954049a2b0e709c51b9eacfe
msgid ""
"**Description**: Builds a comprehensive graph of tool compatibility "
"relationships in ToolUniverse. Analyzes all available tools and creates a"
" directed graph showing which tools can be composed together."
msgstr "**描述**：构建ToolUniverse中工具兼容性关系的综合图表。分析所有可用工具，并创建一个有向图，显示哪些工具可以组合使用。"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:75 251fe440a504400fadfa33e9172a4386
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``output_path`` (string) (required) Path to save the generated graph "
"files (JSON and pickle formats)"
msgstr "``output_path``（字符串）（可选）用于保存生成的图文件的路径（JSON 和 pickle 格式）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:78 7123586f415c4973a188834a25ee5665
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``analysis_depth`` (string) (required) Level of compatibility analysis to"
" perform"
msgstr "``analysis_depth``（字符串）（可选）执行兼容性分析的深度级别"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:81 32cffe5947f341a79f140852abf60cbd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``min_compatibility_score`` (integer) (required) Minimum compatibility "
"score to create an edge in the graph"
msgstr "``min_compatibility_score``（整数）（可选）创建图中边所需的最低兼容性分数"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:84 994306218c194f6c9e6affad49ac8707
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``exclude_categories`` (array) (required) Tool categories to exclude from"
" analysis (e.g., ['tool\\_finder', 'special\\_tools'])"
msgstr ""
"``exclude_categories``（数组）（可选）要从分析中排除的工具类别（例如：['tool_finder', "
"'special_tools']）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:87 9b1e3a3c4cd248a7bb056748bb206e48
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_tools_per_category`` (integer) (required) Maximum number of tools "
"to analyze per category (for performance)"
msgstr "``max_tools_per_category``（整数）（可选）每个类别中要分析的工具最大数量（用于性能优化）"

#: ../../tools/tool_composition_tools.rst:90 b547186f2a3d41339b2a6789595610da
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``force_rebuild`` (boolean) (required) Whether to force rebuild even if "
"cached graph exists"
msgstr "``force_rebuild``（布尔值）（可选）是否在已存在缓存图的情况下强制重新构建"

